@startuml DiagrammeArchitecturePhysiqueTPE
title Architecture physique - Systeme de gestion du parc TPE bancaire

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #2F3A4A
}

skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #EEF6FF
  BorderColor #2F3A4A
}

skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #2F3A4A
}

actor "Agent agence" as Agence
actor "Service\nmonetique" as Monetique
actor "Administrateur" as Admin

node "Poste utilisateur" as Poste {
  artifact "Navigateur Web\nChrome / Edge" as Browser
}

node "Serveur applicatif" as AppServer {
  node "JVM Java 17" as JVM {
    artifact "tpe-management-1.0.0.jar" as Jar

    component "Tomcat embarque" as Tomcat
    component "Application Spring Boot\nPort 8080" as SpringBoot
    component "API REST\n/api/**" as ApiRest
    component "Spring Security\nJWT" as Security
    component "Frontend Angular compile\nresources/static" as AngularStatic
  }

  folder "uploads/\nPieces jointes" as Uploads
  folder "logs/\ntpe-management.log" as Logs
}

database "Serveur base de donnees\nMySQL\nlocalhost:3306\nBase: TPE_Managements" as MySQL

cloud "Service Power BI\noptionnel / desactive" as PowerBI
artifact "Fichier bancaire\nExcel / TXT" as BankFile

Agence --> Browser
Monetique --> Browser
Admin --> Browser

Browser --> AngularStatic : HTTP\npages Angular
Browser --> ApiRest : HTTP / JSON\nBearer JWT

Jar *-- Tomcat
Jar *-- SpringBoot
SpringBoot *-- ApiRest
SpringBoot *-- Security
SpringBoot *-- AngularStatic

ApiRest --> Security : controle authentification\net autorisations
ApiRest --> MySQL : JDBC / JPA / Hibernate
ApiRest --> Uploads : lecture / ecriture\npieces jointes
ApiRest --> Logs : journalisation applicative

BankFile --> ApiRest : import fichier bancaire
ApiRest ..> PowerBI : rapports / indicateurs\nsi active

note right of AppServer
Deploiement principal:
le backend Spring Boot expose l'API REST
et peut servir le frontend Angular compile
depuis resources/static.
end note

note bottom of MySQL
Configuration active:
spring.datasource.url =
jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/TPE_Managements
end note

note bottom of Browser
En developpement, Angular peut aussi
etre lance sur localhost:4200
et consommer l'API localhost:8080/api.
end note

@enduml
